<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Curio launcher icon — foreground layer.

    Redesigned (replaces the 6-wedge wheel from commit ac9a0742). Cleaner,
    more iconic, more legible at 24dp launcher sizes. Uses the primary
    palette prominently — the cream wheel on the coral background pops as
    a single recognizable silhouette before any inner detail resolves.

    Composition (see CURIO_SPEC.md §13.1 + §0.2 + §5):
      1. Cream wheel circle — r=30 centered at (54,54). This sits fully
         inside the 66dp adaptive-icon safe zone (r=33 from center).
      2. Three colored wedges forming the roulette dial — using the
         secondary/tertiary accents (butter yellow, sky mint, lilac) that
         sit next to coral on the warm side of the palette. Three wedges
         instead of six = legibility at small sizes (each wedge reads as
         a distinct slice rather than blurring into a colored ring).
           - Wedge 1 (12-4 o'clock):  Butter Yellow #FFD97D
           - Wedge 2 (4-8 o'clock):  Sky Mint     #8FE3CF
           - Wedge 3 (8-12 o'clock): Lilac        #C9A6F2
      3. Pointer (deep plum #3B0A17 triangle) at the top — apex at (54,24)
         touching the wheel's top edge, base at y=14. Points DOWN at the
         wheel: the classic roulette-prize-wheel visual cue from §5.
      4. Sparkle (butter yellow 4-point star) at top-left (24,24). Signals
         "delight" without competing with the wheel. Color matches wedge 1
         so it feels intentional, not random.

    Geometry: dial center = (54,54); dial radius = 30 (so wheel spans
    r=0 to r=30 from center, well inside the 33dp safe-zone edge).
    Pointer apex sits AT the wheel's top edge (y=24) — the pointer extends
    UP from there (base at y=14), so the pointer is fully outside the wheel
    and never gets clipped by launcher masks. Sparkle at (24,24) is
    inside the safe zone but small (r=6).

    No gradients — per CURIO_SPEC.md §0.2, gradients are reserved for the
    Wildcard use case only. Keeping the foreground flat makes the icon
    legible at every launcher density.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="108dp"
    android:height="108dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">

    <!-- ── Wheel body: solid cream circle, r=30 from (54,54) ────────── -->
    <path android:fillColor="#FFFBF5"
          android:pathData="M 54,24 A 30,30 0 1,1 54,84 A 30,30 0 1,1 54,24 Z" />

    <!-- ── Wedge 1 (12-4 o'clock): Butter Yellow ─────────────────────── -->
    <path android:fillColor="#FFD97D"
          android:pathData="M 54,54 L 54,24 A 30,30 0 0,1 79.98,69 Z" />

    <!-- ── Wedge 2 (4-8 o'clock): Sky Mint ─────────────────────────── -->
    <path android:fillColor="#8FE3CF"
          android:pathData="M 54,54 L 79.98,69 A 30,30 0 0,1 28.02,69 Z" />

    <!-- ── Wedge 3 (8-12 o'clock): Lilac ────────────────────────────── -->
    <path android:fillColor="#C9A6F2"
          android:pathData="M 54,54 L 28.02,69 A 30,30 0 0,1 54,24 Z" />

    <!-- ── Pointer: deep plum triangle, apex at wheel's top edge ─────── -->
    <path android:fillColor="#3B0A17"
          android:pathData="M 54,24 L 50,14 L 58,14 Z" />

    <!-- ── Sparkle: butter yellow 4-point star at top-left ──────────── -->
    <path android:fillColor="#FFD97D"
          android:pathData="M 24,18 L 26,22 L 30,24 L 26,26 L 24,30 L 22,26 L 18,24 L 22,22 Z" />
</vector>